'>{}</span>", "ja458:18.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja458:18.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja458:18.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja458:19.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja458:19.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja458:19.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja458:19.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja458:20.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja458:20.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja458:20.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja458:20.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja458:21.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja458:21.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja458:21.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja458:21.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p>", "ja458:22.1": "<p><span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja458:22.2": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja458:22.3": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja458:22.4": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja458:22.5": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span>", "ja458:22.6": "<span class='verse-line'>{}</span></p></blockquote>", "ja458:23.1": "<p class='endsutta'>{}</p></article>"}, "root_text": {"ja458:0.1": "Jātaka ", "ja458:0.2": "Ekādasakanipāta ", "ja458:0.3": "Mātuposakavagga ", "ja458:0.4": "4. Udayajātaka ", "ja458:1.1": "“Ekā nisinnā suci saññatūrū, ", "ja458:1.2": "Pāsādamāruyha aninditaṅgī; ", "ja458:1.3": "Yācāmi taṁ kinnaranettacakkhu, ", "ja458:1.4": "Imekarattiṁ ubhayo vasema”. ", "ja458:2.1": "“Okiṇṇantaraparikhaṁ, ", "ja458:2.2": "daḷhamaṭṭālakoṭṭhakaṁ; ", "ja458:2.3": "Rakkhitaṁ khaggahatthehi, ", "ja458:2.4": "duppavesamidaṁ puraṁ. ", "ja458:3.1": "Daharassa yuvino cāpi, ", "ja458:3.2": "āgamo ca na vijjati; ", "ja458:3.3": "Atha kena nu vaṇṇena, ", "ja458:3.4": "saṅgamaṁ icchase mayā”. ", "ja458:4.1": "“Yakkhohamasmi kalyāṇi, ", "ja458:4.2": "Āgatosmi tavantike; ", "ja458:4.3": "Tvaṁ maṁ nandaya bhaddante, ", "ja458:4.4": "Puṇṇakaṁsaṁ dadāmi te”. ", "ja458:5.1": "“Devaṁ va yakkhaṁ atha vā manussaṁ, ", "ja458:5.2": "Na patthaye udayamaticca aññaṁ; ", "ja458:5.3": "Gaccheva tvaṁ yakkha mahānubhāva, ", "ja458:5.4": "Mā cassu gantvā punarāvajittha”. ", "ja458:6.1": "“Yā sā rati uttamā kāmabhoginaṁ, ", "ja458:6.2": "Yaṁ hetu sattā visamaṁ caranti; ", "ja458:6.3": "Mā taṁ ratiṁ jīyi tuvaṁ sucimhite, ", "ja458:6.4": "Dadāmi te rūpiyaṁ kaṁsapūraṁ”. ", "ja458:7.1": "“Nāriṁ naro nijjhapayaṁ dhanena, ", "ja458:7.2": "Ukkaṁsatī yattha karoti chandaṁ; ", "ja458:7.3": "Vipaccanīko tava devadhammo, ", "ja458:7.4": "Paccakkhato thokatarena esi”. ", "ja458:8.1": "“Āyu ca vaṇṇo ca manussaloke, ", "ja458:8.2": "Nihīyati manujānaṁ sugatte; ", "ja458:8.3": "Teneva vaṇṇena dhanampi tuyhaṁ, ", "ja458:8.4": "Nihīyati jiṇṇatarāsi ajja. ", "ja458:9.1": "Evaṁ me pekkhamānassa, ", "ja458:9.2": "rājaputti yasassini; ", "ja458:9.3": "Hāyateva tava vaṇṇo, ", "ja458:9.4": "ahorattānamaccaye”. ", "ja458:10.1": "“Imināva tvaṁ vayasā, ", "ja458:10.2": "rājaputti sumedhase; ", "ja458:10.3": "Brahmacariyaṁ careyyāsi, ", "ja458:10.4": "bhiyyo vaṇṇavatī siyā”. ", "ja458:11.1": "“Devā na jīranti yathā manussā, ", "ja458:11.2": "Gattesu tesaṁ valiyo na honti; ", "ja458:11.3": "Pucchāmi taṁ yakkha mahānubhāva, ", "ja458:11.4": "Kathaṁ nu devāna sarīradeho”. ", "ja458:12.1": "“Devā na jīranti yathā manussā, ", "ja458:12.2": "Gattesu tesaṁ valiyo na honti; ", "ja458:12.3": "Suve suve bhiyyatarova tesaṁ, ", "ja458:12.4": "Dibbo ca vaṇṇo vipulā ca bhogā”. ", "ja458:13.1": "“Kiṁsūdha bhītā janatā anekā, ", "ja458:13.2": "Maggo ca nekāyatanaṁ pavutto; ", "ja458:13.3": "Pucchāmi taṁ yakkha mahānubhāva, ", "ja458:13.4": "Katthaṭṭhito paralokaṁ na bhāye”. ", "ja458:14.1": "“Vācaṁ manañca paṇidhāya sammā, ", "ja458:14.2": "Kāyena pāpāni akubbamāno; ", "ja458:14.3": "Bahunnapānaṁ gharamāvasanto, ", "ja458:14.4": "Saddho mudū saṁvibhāgī vadaññū; ", "ja458:14.5": "Saṅgāhako sakhilo saṇhavāco, ", "ja458:14.6": "Etthaṭṭhito paralokaṁ na bhāye”. ", "ja458:15.1": "“Anusāsasi maṁ yakkha, ", "ja458:15.2": "yathā mātā yathā pitā; ", "ja458:15.3": "Uḷāravaṇṇaṁ pucchāmi, ", "ja458:15.4": "ko nu tvamasi subrahā”. ", "ja458:16.1": "“Udayohamasmi kalyāṇi, ", "ja458:16.2": "saṅgarattā idhāgato; ", "ja458:16.3": "Āmanta kho taṁ gacchāmi, ", "ja458:16.4": "muttosmi tava saṅgarā”. ", "ja458:17.1": "“Sace kho tvaṁ udayosi, ", "ja458:17.2": "saṅgarattā idhāgato; ", "ja458:17.3": "Anusāsa maṁ rājaputta, ", "ja458:17.4": "yathāssa puna saṅgamo”. ", "ja458:18.1": "“Atipatati vayo khaṇo tatheva, ", "ja458:18.2": "Ṭhānaṁ natthi dhuvaṁ cavanti sattā; ", "ja458:18.3": "Parijiyyati addhuvaṁ sarīraṁ, ", "ja458:18.4": "Udaye mā pamāda carassu dhammaṁ. ", "ja458:19.1": "Kasiṇā pathavī dhanassa pūrā, ", "ja458:19.2": "Ekasseva siyā anaññadheyyā; ", "ja458:19.3": "Tañcāpi jahati avītarāgo, ", "ja458:19.4": "Udaye mā pamāda carassu dhammaṁ. ", "ja458:20.1": "Mātā ca pitā ca bhātaro ca, ", "ja458:20.2": "Bhariyā yāpi dhanena hoti kītā; ", "ja458:20.3": "Te cāpi jahanti aññamaññaṁ, ", "ja458:20.4": "Udaye mā pamāda carassu dhammaṁ. ", "ja458:21.1": "Kāyo parabhojananti ñatvā, ", "ja458:21.2": "Saṁsāre sugatiñca duggatiñca; ", "ja458:21.3": "Ittaravāsoti jāniyāna, ", "ja458:21.4": "Udaye mā pamāda carassu dhammaṁ”. ", "ja458:22.1": "“Sādhu bhāsatiyaṁ yakkho, ", "ja458:22.2": "appaṁ maccāna jīvitaṁ; ", "ja458:22.3": "Kasirañca parittañca, ", "ja458:22.4": "tañca dukkhena saṁyutaṁ; ", "ja458:22.5": "Sāhaṁ ekā pabbajissāmi, ", "ja458:22.6": "hitvā kāsiṁ surundhanan”ti. ", "ja458:23.1": "Udayajātakaṁ catutthaṁ. "}, "variant_text": {"ja458:0.1": "", "ja458:0.2": "", "ja458:0.3": "", "ja458:0.4": "", "ja458:1.1": "", "ja458:1.2": "", "ja458:1.3": "", "ja458:1.4": "", "ja458:2.1": "", "ja458:2.2": "", "ja458:2.3": "", "ja458:2.4": "", "ja458:3.1": "", "ja458:3.2": "", "ja458:3.3": "", "ja458:3.4": "", "ja458:4.1": "", "ja458:4.2": "tavantike → tavantikaṁ (bj); tamantikaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja458:4.3": "nandaya → nandassu (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja458:4.4": "", "ja458:5.1": "", "ja458:5.2": "", "ja458:5.3": "", "ja458:5.4": "", "ja458:6.1": "", "ja458:6.2": "", "ja458:6.3": "", "ja458:6.4": "", "ja458:7.1": "", "ja458:7.2": "", "ja458:7.3": "", "ja458:7.4": "", "ja458:8.1": "ca vaṇṇo ca → āyuñca vaṇṇañca (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja458:8.2": "", "ja458:8.3": "", "ja458:8.4": "", "ja458:9.1": "", "ja458:9.2": "", "ja458:9.3": "Hāyateva tava → hāyate vata te (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, mr); hāyateva tato (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja458:9.4": "", "ja458:10.1": "", "ja458:10.2": "", "ja458:10.3": "", "ja458:10.4": "", "ja458:11.1": "", "ja458:11.2": "", "ja458:11.3": "", "ja458:11.4": "Kathaṁ nu devāna → kathaṁ na devānaṁ (pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja458:12.1": "", "ja458:12.2": "", "ja458:12.3": "bhiyyatarova → bhiyyataro ca (mr) ", "ja458:12.4": "", "ja458:13.1": "", "ja458:13.2": "", "ja458:13.3": "", "ja458:13.4": "", "ja458:14.1": "", "ja458:14.2": "", "ja458:14.3": "", "ja458:14.4": "", "ja458:14.5": "", "ja458:14.6": "", "ja458:15.1": "", "ja458:15.2": "", "ja458:15.3": "", "ja458:15.4": "", "ja458:16.1": "", "ja458:16.2": "saṅgarattā idhāgato → saṅgaratthā idhāgato (bj, pts-vp-pli1); saṅkaratthāyidhāgato (sya1ed, sya2ed) ", "ja458:16.3": "", "ja458:16.4": "saṅgarā → saṅkarā (sya1ed, sya2ed, mr) ", "ja458:17.1": "", "ja458:17.2": "", "ja458:17.3": "", "ja458:17.4": "", "ja458:18.1": "Atipatati → adhipatati (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja458:18.2": "", "ja458:18.3": "", "ja458:18.4": "Udaye mā pamāda → mā pamādaṁ (bj) ", "ja458:19.1": "", "ja458:19.2": "", "ja458:19.3": "jahati → jahāti (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1); jahātī (?) ", "ja458:19.4": "", "ja458:20.1": "", "ja458:20.2": "Bhariyā yāpi dhanena hoti kītā → bhariyā sāmiko sadhanena hoti (sya1ed, sya2ed); bhariyāpi dhanena honti atittā (mr) ", "ja458:20.3": "", "ja458:20.4": "", "ja458:21.1": "parabhojananti ñatvā → kāyo parabhojananti viditvā (sya1ed, sya2ed); kāyo ca parabhojanaṁ viditvā (mr) ", "ja458:21.2": "sugatiñca duggatiñca → sugatī ca duggatī ca (bj, sya1ed, sya2ed, pts-vp-pli1); suggatiṁ duggatiñca (mr) ", "ja458:21.3": "", "ja458:21.4": "", "ja458:22.1": "bhāsatiyaṁ → bhāsatayaṁ (bj, pts-vp-pli1) ", "ja458:22.2": "", "ja458:22.3": "", "ja458:22.4": "", "ja458:22.5": "", "ja458:22.6": "", "ja458:23.1": ""}, "reference_text": {"ja458:0.1": "", "ja458:0.2": "", "ja458:0.3": "", "ja458:0.4": "", "ja458:1.1": "bj30.396, dr27.308, ms22J_2146, msdiv37, pts-vp-pli4.106, sya27.310, vri68.181", "ja458:1.2": "", "ja458:1.3": "", "ja458:1.4": "", "ja458:2.1": "ms22J_2147, msdiv38", "ja458:2.2": "", "ja458:2.3": "", "ja458:2.4": "", "ja458:3.1": "ms22J_2148, msdiv39", "ja458:3.2": "", "ja458:3.3": "", "ja458:3.4": "", "ja458:4.1": "ms22J_2149, msdiv40, pts-vp-pli4.107", "ja458:4.2": "", "ja458:4.3": "", "ja458:4.4": "", "ja458:5.1": "ms22J_2150, msdiv41, ndp22.224", "ja458:5.2": "", "ja458:5.3": "", "ja458:5.4": "", "ja458:6.1": "ms22J_2151, msdiv42", "ja458:6.2": "", "ja458:6.3": "", "ja458:6.4": "", "ja458:7.1": "csp1ed22.232, csp2ed22.232, dr27.309, ms22J_2152, msdiv43, pts-vp-pli4.108, sya27.311", "ja458:7.2": "", "ja458:7.3": "", "ja458:7.4": "", "ja458:8.1": "ms22J_2153, msdiv44", "ja458:8.2": "", "ja458:8.3": "", "ja458:8.4": "", "ja458:9.1": "ms22J_2154, msdiv45", "ja458:9.2": "", "ja458:9.3": "", "ja458:9.4": "", "ja458:10.1": "ms22J_2155, msdiv46", "ja458:10.2": "", "ja458:10.3": "", "ja458:10.4": "", "ja458:11.1": "bj30.398, ms22J_2156, msdiv47, pts-vp-pli4.109", "ja458:11.2": "", "ja458:11.3": "", "ja458:11.4": "", "ja458:12.1": "ms22J_2157, msdiv48, ndp22.225, sya27.312", "ja458:12.2": "", "ja458:12.3": "", "ja458:12.4": "", "ja458:13.1": "dr27.310, ms22J_2158, msdiv49, pts-vp-pli4.110", "ja458:13.2": "", "ja458:13.3": "", "ja458:13.4": "", "ja458:14.1": "csp1ed22.233, csp2ed22.233, ms22J_2159, msdiv50, vri68.182", "ja458:14.2": "", "ja458:14.3": "", "ja458:14.4": "", "ja458:14.5": "", "ja458:14.6": "", "ja458:15.1": "ms22J_2160, msdiv51, pts-vp-pli4.111", "ja458:15.2": "", "ja458:15.3": "", "ja458:15.4": "", "ja458:16.1": "ms22J_2161, msdiv52